 2 | a pair soft deleted                       | t    | t     | ccccdc
 3 | a pair deleted                            | t    | t     | cdcccc
 4 | a pair moved to another key               | t    | t     | ccdccd
 5 | a soft deleted pair restored              | t    | t     | ccccdc
